# Module
ModuleZugferdName = ZUGFeRD / XRechnung
ModuleZugferdDesc = Export customer invoices as XRechnung XML and ZUGFeRD PDF
ModuleZugferdDescLong = Creates XRechnung 3 (CII) and ZUGFeRD 2 / Factur-X (profile EN 16931) from validated customer invoices.
#
# Setup
ZugferdSetup = ZUGFeRD / XRechnung setup
ZugferdSetupPage = Mandatory data comes from Company/Organization, bank account and customer. Customers get the extra fields Leitweg-ID and electronic address.
ZugferdCheckTitle = Master data check
ZugferdCheckLibrary = PHP libraries (vendor)
ZugferdTaxNumber = Tax number
ZugferdStrictMode = Strict mode
ZugferdStrictModeHelp = Requires full contact data (phone, e-mail, customer address) also for ZUGFeRD, as for XRechnung.
ZugferdRequireLeitweg = Require Leitweg-ID on the customer
ZugferdRequireLeitwegHelp = If enabled, no file is created without Leitweg-ID (BT-10). Otherwise the customer code is used as buyer reference.
ZugferdDeliveryDateIsInvoiceDate = Delivery date = invoice date
ZugferdDeliveryDateIsInvoiceDateHelp = If no service period is set on the lines, the invoice date is sent as actual delivery date (BT-72).
ZugferdDefaultZeroCategory = VAT category for domestic 0% lines
ZugferdDefaultZeroCategoryHelp = Only for customers in your own country when the VAT dictionary has no code (E, AE, Z, K, G, O). EU and non-EU customers are detected automatically.
ZugferdZeroCategoryNone = none (stop export with a message)
ZugferdZeroCategoryE = E - exempt from VAT
ZugferdZeroCategoryAE = AE - reverse charge
ZugferdZeroCategoryZ = Z - zero rated
ZugferdExemptReason = Exemption reason for category E
ZugferdExemptReasonHelp = Text for BT-120.
ZugferdSmallBusinessText = Small business note
ZugferdSmallBusinessTextHelp = Used when the company is not subject to VAT (Company/Organization). Empty = default text.
ZugferdSellerContact = Seller contact
ZugferdSellerContactHelp = BT-41. Empty = managers of Company/Organization, otherwise company name.
ZugferdSellerTaxNumberField = Field holding the tax number
ZugferdSellerTaxNumberFieldHelp = Company field used for the tax number (BT-32). Only used if it looks like a tax number.
#
# Invoice card
ZugferdGenerateXml = Create XRechnung
ZugferdGenerateXmlHelp = Creates the XRechnung 3 (XML) and stores it with the invoice documents
ZugferdGeneratePdf = Create ZUGFeRD
ZugferdGeneratePdfHelp = Creates a PDF/A-3 with embedded invoice (ZUGFeRD EN 16931) and stores it with the documents
ZugferdXmlGenerated = XRechnung %s was saved with the invoice.
ZugferdPdfGenerated = ZUGFeRD PDF %s was saved with the invoice.
ZugferdLeitwegId = Leitweg-ID
ZugferdLeitwegIdHelp = BT-10, mandatory for XRechnung to German public authorities (e.g. 991-12345-67)
ZugferdEndpointId = Electronic address
ZugferdEndpointIdHelp = BT-49, e.g. e-mail address for e-invoices. Empty = customer e-mail.
#
# Exemption reasons (BT-120)
ZugferdReasonSmallBusiness = No VAT charged according to section 19 UStG (small business).
ZugferdReasonExempt = VAT exempt supply
ZugferdReasonReverseCharge = Reverse charge
ZugferdReasonIntraCommunity = Exempt intra-community supply
ZugferdReasonExport = Exempt export supply
ZugferdReasonNotSubject = Not subject to VAT in the country of the seller
#
# Errors
ZugferdErrorTitle = E-invoice was not created:
ZugferdErrorNotValidated = The invoice must be validated.
ZugferdErrorNoPermission = Not allowed to create invoice documents.
ZugferdErrorBadToken = Invalid security token. Please reload the page and try again.
ZugferdErrorMissingVendor = PHP libraries are missing (vendor folder). Please install the complete module package.
ZugferdErrorNoPdf = Invoice PDF is missing and could not be created.
ZugferdErrorBuildFailed = E-invoice could not be created (details in the Dolibarr log).
ZugferdErrorSaveFailed = The file could not be saved.
ZugferdErrorMissingRef = Invoice number is missing.
ZugferdErrorMissingSellerName = Company name is missing (Company/Organization).
ZugferdErrorMissingSellerAddress = Company address is incomplete (street, zip, town, country).
ZugferdErrorMissingSellerTax = Company VAT number or tax number is missing.
ZugferdErrorMissingSellerVatForIC = The company VAT number is mandatory for exempt intra-community supplies.
ZugferdErrorMissingSellerLegalId = Not subject to VAT (category O) requires the company registration number or tax number.
ZugferdErrorMissingSellerEmail = Company e-mail is missing (Company/Organization, BT-34/BT-43).
ZugferdErrorMissingSellerPhone = Company phone is missing (Company/Organization, BT-42).
ZugferdErrorMissingBuyerName = Customer name is missing.
ZugferdErrorMissingBuyerCountry = Customer country is missing.
ZugferdErrorMissingBuyerAddress = Customer address is incomplete (street, zip, town).
ZugferdErrorMissingBuyerEmail = Customer electronic address is missing (customer e-mail or extra field, BT-49).
ZugferdErrorMissingBuyerVat = Customer VAT number is missing (mandatory for reverse charge and intra-community supply).
ZugferdErrorMissingLeitweg = Leitweg-ID is missing on the customer.
ZugferdErrorInvalidLeitweg = Leitweg-ID "%s" has an invalid format.
ZugferdErrorMissingIban = IBAN is missing (bank account of the invoice or default account in Setup - Invoices).
ZugferdErrorMissingPaymentTerms = Payment terms or due date are missing.
ZugferdErrorNoLines = The invoice has no exportable lines.
ZugferdErrorForeignCurrency = Invoices in foreign currency (%s) are not supported.
ZugferdErrorZeroVatCategory = VAT category of the 0% line "%s" is unclear. Set a code (E, AE, Z) in the VAT dictionary or choose a default category in the module setup.
ZugferdErrorCategoryNeedsZeroRate = Category %s requires 0% VAT (line "%s").
ZugferdErrorMixedNotSubjectToVat = Lines not subject to VAT (O) must not be mixed with other VAT categories.
ZugferdErrorVatRounding = VAT at %s %% differs: invoice %s, calculated %s. Please check the rounding setting (MAIN_ROUNDOFTOTAL_NOT_TOTALOFROUND).
ZugferdErrorTotalsMismatch = Invoice total %s does not match the sum of the lines %s.
